:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Manipula&#231;&#227;o Sangu&#237;nea - Nesta forma, as criaturas est&#227;o muito mais vulner&#225;veis, por n&#227;o estarem dentro de um corpo, logo \possuem muito mais limita&#231;&#245;es em sua manipula&#231;&#227;o sangu&#237;nea, mas ainda podem bater nos inimigos \(Dano/2\), correr \(ou o equivalente disso\) para desviar de ataques, envolver os inimigos para tentar sufoc&#225;-los e absorver nutr\ientes para regenerar SC.</span></p></body>)/Rect[176.434 657.978 513.963 715.988]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj56 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(                                                                                                         AnotaÁıes\r)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 17.1 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 17.1pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240907221411-03'00')/NM(5f15e8eb9fc54a00959a0547e7205bd6)/Page 3/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:17.1pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">                                                                                                         Anota&#231;&#245;es&#13;</span></p></body>)/Rect[255.579 669.124 342.052 727.274]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj57 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240916144227-03'00')/NM(d22bedd642ee4046b0d883ddb2b6cb22)/Page 3/Rect[67.0267 634.469 261.76 646.669]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>